@ Index:   Currency Conversion: USD -> DRC Francs
@ Author:  Jonathan M. Cameron
@ Version: 1
@
@ Variables:  Uses 'Taux', number of DRC Francs per USD
@    2400 STO 'Taux'
@ 
@ Input:   Number of USD to convert to DRC Francs
@ Output:  DRC Francs
@
@ Test:  1 Fc ==> 2400

LBL ‘Fc’
  RCL ‘Taux’
  ×
